  "details": "AMI APTIOV contains vulnerabilities in BIOS where\nprivileged users may cause the “Out-of-Bounds Read” by\nlocal access. Successful exploitation of this vulnerability may lead to a\ndenial of service during firmware update processing, such as a crash or failed\nupdate if the out-of-bounds read hits unmapped memory. It could also impact\nConfidentiality, and Availability.",
